(* UT_STATUS_TEXT — a block's status line in words (function): the status,
or the kind of fault / warning / setting problem and which one.

Data.statusText := UT_STATUS_TEXT(Data.statusCode, Data.faultId);

'Running: Auto', 'Waiting: restart delay', 'Latched: overload',
'Warning: current signal', 'Config: valve type'. At most 30 characters.
Every block shares it, so the words are in flash once. Blocks call it only
when the status or the fault changes. The times and numbers that go with a
status are in the record (timeLeft, runningCount, ...), not in the text. *)

